      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you can implement your thing like a regular XxxManager, then yes, please go ahead with that.\n\nThe modules using this pattern don\u0027t fit in that pattern -- e.g. TelephonyManager needs to be able to call waitForService() anytime because the service process may restart anytime.\n\nBasically if your service process won\u0027t die, you can probably use the XxxManager pattern.",
